<title>FRANCE: SocGen issues 800 mln Ffr 2009 bond.</title>
<headline>SocGen issues 800 mln Ffr 2009 bond.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond issue was announced by Societe Generale.</p>
<p>BORROWER - Societe Generale</p>
<p> AMT   800 MLN FRF	COUPON     5.90	MATURITY 23.JUL.09</p>
<p> TYPE  STRAIGHT	   ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE 23.JUL.97</p>
<p>NOTE - Societe Generale said the issue amount could be raised to 960 million francs. It said the issue was aimed at its own retail banking clients and would be sold in 5,000 franc denominations, giving a first coupon of 295 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542 cla/</p>
</text>
